*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0046
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 471
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0046.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CS-SCR             PIC 9(3).
    *> DEBT TO INCOME RATIO
    05 DR-RT              PIC 9V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 WS-DEC             PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM DECIDE-APPLICATION
    DISPLAY "WS-DEC=" WS-DEC
    STOP RUN.
DECIDE-APPLICATION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
        WHEN CS-SCR >= 740 AND DR-RT < 0.43
            MOVE 'A' TO WS-DEC
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        WHEN CS-SCR GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 620
            MOVE 'R' TO WS-DEC
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO WS-DEC
    END-EVALUATE.
